{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Notice {{ bank_name }} {{ ev.case_id }}{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<p style="text-align:center"><b>OFFICE OF THE INVESTIGATING OFFICER</b><br>
  {{ ev.case.police_station or "Police Station ________________" }}</p>
<p>No. ________________ &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Date: ________________</p>
<p>To,<br>{{ address }}</p>

<p><b>Subject:</b> Notice under Section 94 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, 2023 (corresponding to Section 91
of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973) read with Section 168 BNSS: request to place a debit hold limited to the
disputed amount on the account(s) below, and to furnish records.</p>
<p><b>Reference:</b> FIR No. {{ ev.case.fir_no or "________" }} · NCRP acknowledgement No. {{ ev.case.ncrp_ack or "________" }}
  · Case {{ ev.case_id }}</p>

<p>Sir / Madam,</p>
<p>During the investigation of the above case, money transferred from the complainant's account
{{ victim.account }} ({{ victim.bank_name }}, IFSC {{ victim.ifsc }}) has been traced, through the transactions listed
below, into the following account(s) maintained with your bank. You are requested, in the interest of the
investigation, to:</p>
<ol>
  <li>place a debit hold (lien) on each account below <b>limited to the amount shown</b> in the last column, without
      freezing the rest of the account; and</li>
  <li>furnish the records listed after the table.</li>
</ol>

<!--FACTS-->
<table>
  <tr><th>Account No.</th><th>IFSC</th><th>Disputed credit(s): transaction ID, date-time, amount (victim money)</th>
      <th class="num">Amount to hold</th></tr>
  {% for a in rows %}
  <tr>
    <td class="mono">{{ a.account }}</td><td class="mono">{{ a.ifsc }}</td>
    <td>{% for t in credits[a.eid] %}<span class="mono">{{ t.transaction_id }}</span>, {{ t.ts }}, {{ t.amount_paise|inr }}
        ({{ t.attributed_paise|inr }}){% if not loop.last %}<br>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</td>
    <td class="num"><b>{{ a.held_paise|inr }}</b></td>
  </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  <tr><th colspan="3">Total to hold at {{ bank_name }}</th><th class="num">{{ bank_total|inr }}</th></tr>
</table>
<!--/FACTS-->

<p><b>Records requested</b> for each account above:</p>
<ol>
  <li>KYC documents and account opening form, with the mobile number and e-mail linked to the account;</li>
  <li>account statement from {{ period[0] }} to {{ period[1] }};</li>
  <li>other accounts, wallets or UPI handles linked to the same customer;</li>
  <li>device, IP address and login logs for the period;</li>
  <li>beneficiary and exit details for onward transfers (wallet IDs, UPI handles, ATM IDs, merchant IDs).</li>
</ol>
<p>Please furnish the above within ______ days of receipt of this notice.</p>

<div class="sign"><div>Place: ________________<br>Date: ________________</div>
  <div>(Signature)<br>{{ ev.case.io_name or "Investigating Officer: ________________" }}<br>
  {{ ev.case.police_station or "Police Station ________________" }}</div></div>
{% endblock %}
